{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05282","headline":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 萧至忠","name":"奉和九月九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天跸三乘啓，星舆六辔行。\n登高凌宝塔，极目徧王城。\n神衞空中遶，仙歌云外清。\n重阳千万寿，率舞颂昇平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"萧至忠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05282.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05282","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}